newspaper_text = "[center][b][font_size=26]THE NEWBURKE TIMES[/font_size][/b][/center]

[b][font_size=20]RIPEYE SLAIN: SERIAL KILLER'S REIGN ENDS AT LAST[/font_size][/b]

Detective Ethan Hayes closes the case after a months-long manhunt

Authorities confirmed Thursday that the killer known only as
\"Ripeye\" is dead, following a confrontation with Detective
Ethan Hayes. Hayes, who led the investigation since early this
year, refused to comment on the circumstances.

[i]\"Newburke can rest easy,\"[/i] said Hayes's partner, Detective
Marcus. [i]\"Ethan didn't stop until it was over.\"[/i]

The department declined to comment further, citing an internal
review of the incident."
